<SiteLayout title="交流与实践 · 蜂巢" description="了解蜂巢的设计取舍、典型业务任务、ACDL研发方法与HiveFlow自动化实践。"><section class="page-intro container"><span class="eyebrow">IDEAS & PRACTICE / 交流与实践</span><h1>产品之外，<br/><em>还有值得说明的选择。</em></h1><p>从架构取舍到业务例子，记录为什么这样建设蜂巢。<br/>把交流材料转成可以持续阅读、逐步补充的内容。</p></section><section class="section container no-top-padding"><DocCards docs={sectionDocs('insights')}/><div class="related-acdl"><span class="eyebrow">RELATED READING</span><h2>蜂巢的研发方法与自动化实践</h2><p>ACDL介绍如何组织需求、设计、实施与验证。HiveFlow介绍如何把开发者反馈接到调查、开发和交付。</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button primary" href="https://www.bluexiii.com/acdl/">前往ACDL网站<Icon name="external" size={18}/></a><a class="button" href="https://www.bluexiii.com/flow/">前往HiveFlow网站<Icon name="external" size={18}/></a></div></div></section><section class="end-note container"><p>现有交流材料按当前产品重新整理。<br/>历史演示、设计意图与真实环境验证各有适用范围，不能互相替代。</p><a class="inline-link" href={url('/docs/')}>回到文档中心<Icon name="arrow" size={18}/></a></section></SiteLayout>
